#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "help.cedarloom-app"
msgstr ""
"Usage: cedarloom-app [--port <n>] [--no-open] [--plugin-root <dir>] [--json]\n"
"\n"
"Starts the CedarLoom app for the project in the current folder: a local\n"
"server on 127.0.0.1 that runs until interrupted. Prints its URL with a\n"
"one-time token and opens it in the default browser.\n"
"\n"
"Options:\n"
"  --port <n>           Listen on port <n>. 0, the default, takes a free port.\n"
"  --no-open            Print the URL without opening the browser.\n"
"  --plugin-root <dir>  Use this cl-workflow folder instead of the installed\n"
"                       plugin. Its origin is not checked.\n"
"  --json               Print one JSON document instead of text.\n"
"  --help, -h           Show this usage.\n"
"  --version, -V        Print the version of cedarloom-app."

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid "server.open-hint"
msgstr "If the browser shows an error about a file instead of CedarLoom, open the URL printed above."
